could have the greatest impact.

00:58:12.816 --> 00:58:17.785
And if we didn't
just do that science.

00:58:17.786 --> 00:58:21.625
But also made sure that

00:58:21.626 --> 00:58:23.625
the grad students in

00:58:23.626 --> 00:58:25.140
those poor countries also

00:58:25.141 --> 00:58:27.050
