the art knowledge,

00:58:34.366 --> 00:58:39.585
to their country to bring
that future wealth there,

00:58:39.586 --> 00:58:42.425
instead of us
trying to save them.

00:58:42.426 --> 00:58:45.660
So. Yeah. I think
there's a lot that

00:58:45.661 --> 00:58:48.870
